---
// § 01 · The brief
---

<section class="mx-section mx-section--surface">
  <div class="mx-section__inner">
    <div class="mx-rail" data-reveal>
      <div class="mx-rail__marker">
        <div class="mx-rail__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="mx-rail__label">§ 01 · The brief</div>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-rail__body">
        <h2 class="mx-h2">
          A two-person agency that had to feel <em>substantial</em>.
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-prose">
          Matt was launching a boutique, high-end agency into a market crowded
          with established franchises. A two-person operation had to look and
          feel as substantial as the big brands — while staying personal. The
          site needed to do three jobs at once: win vendor appraisals, surface
          listings to buyers, and publish a steady stream of market commentary
          that Matt could manage himself.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mx-section {
    padding: clamp(52px, 7vw, 92px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px);
  }

  .mx-section--surface {
    background: #fff;
  }

  .mx-section__inner {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .mx-rail {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 170px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 64px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .mx-rail {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
  }

  .mx-rail__rule {
    width: 26px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .mx-rail__label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-charcoal-hover);
  }

  .mx-rail__body {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .mx-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.6vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .mx-h2 em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .mx-prose {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.62;
    color: var(--color-charcoal-hover);
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
